================================================================================
BoostRanker v1.0 — The Boost Trichotomy
  INERT channel  (mod 2): who wins? → binary ranking
  RAMIFIED channel (mod 3): by how much? → confidence
  SPLIT channel   (mod 7): surprise? → anomaly detection
Three truths from one comparison. 42 = 2 * 3 * 7.
================================================================================
